---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base lang="en" page="privacy" title="Privacy policy" description="Le bon civique requires no account, name or email. What technical data is processed, why, and for how long.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">No account, no name, no email. We only process the technical data needed to run and protect the quiz.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Quiz cookie</b> (random identifier): to mark your answers during a game. Strictly necessary; deleted after 2 hours.</li>
      <li><b>Answers of the current game</b>: deleted automatically within 26 hours.</li>
      <li><b>IP address fingerprint</b> (irreversible hash, renewed daily): to limit abuse and automated copying. Kept 48 hours at most.</li>
      <li><b>Cloudflare Turnstile</b> bot check when starting a game. No advertising cookies.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>No data is sold or used for advertising. The site is hosted by Cloudflare, Inc.; the database is located in Europe. Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@leboncivique.fr">contact@leboncivique.fr</a>. You can also complain to the French data protection authority, the <a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en" rel="noopener">CNIL</a>.</p>
    <p>The <a href="/confidentialite/" hreflang="fr">French version</a> prevails.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
